{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a first glimpse into <i>Tape 101</i>, featuring <strong>Chapter 0</strong> and the <strong>first half of Chapter 1</strong>\u2014around <strong>25 to 40 minutes</strong> of gameplay. All core mechanics intended for the full game are present, allowing players to fully experience the main systems and atmosphere early on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Tape 101</i>, you explore the unsettling and seemingly infinite halls of the <strong>Backrooms</strong>, where reality bends and every corridor feels just a little too familiar. Use your <strong>Remote Control car</strong> to scout tight or unreachable areas, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover disturbing layers of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The horror in <i>Tape 101</i> is <strong>psychological and atmospheric</strong>. The game focuses on isolation, discovery, and the creeping realization that not everything is as it seems. The demo sets the tone for what\u2019s to come\u2014<strong>a slow-burn Lore-driven experience</strong> where the greatest threat may not be visible, but quietly takes root in the mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749100/extras/snap.png?t=1748376861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749100/extras/Snap-resizedForSteam.jpg?t=1748376861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unnerving Reality with Deep, Unsettling Secrets That Will Twist Your Perception and Expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749100/extras/Exploration.png?t=1748376861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749100/extras/Exploration-Gif-Optimized.gif?t=1748376861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into an Immersive Experience with Unpredictable Levels, Minimalistic Liminal Spaces, surrounded by eerie ambiance ,Where stunning Visuals Meet Deep Complex Mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749100/extras/rc.png?t=1748376861\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749100/extras/Rc-Gif-Optimized.gif?t=1748376861\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lost in endless, empty halls, your only companion is an RC car, helping you navigate through the eerie silence, to uncover hidden secrets and unravel the mysteries of this realm .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tape 101 is inspired by the internet fictional concept &quot;<strong>The Backrooms&quot;.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Other inspirations includes:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ruster :\u00a0Backrooms - Level 0 \u201cRC Car\u201d (found footage)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kauffman : Backrooms - 2005</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JD Archive :\u00a0The Backrooms - Unknown Tape (Found footage)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kane Pixels :\u00a0The Backrooms (Found Footage)</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3749100?t=1748376861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3749100?t=1748376861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749100/01440f62af0385c6b5873f526d94ce87afe3e6cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748376861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749100/01440f62af0385c6b5873f526d94ce87afe3e6cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748376861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a first glimpse into <i>Tape 101</i>, featuring <strong>Chapter 0</strong> and the <strong>first half of Chapter 1</strong>\u2014around <strong>25 to 40 minutes</strong> of gameplay. All core mechanics intended for the full game are present, allowing players to fully experience the main systems and atmosphere early on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Tape 101</i>, you explore the unsettling and seemingly infinite halls of the <strong>Backrooms</strong>, where reality bends and every corridor feels just a little too familiar. Use your <strong>Remote Control car</strong> to scout tight or unreachable areas, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover disturbing layers of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The horror in <i>Tape 101</i> is <strong>psychological and atmospheric</strong>. The game focuses on isolation, discovery, and the creeping realization that not everything is as it seems. The demo sets the tone for w